      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIVOT (2) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 5 lengths at Sale in a handy 24.25. Has a low draw and has a good record over this journey. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Great chance again. ROVANIEMI (6) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but had to settle for a minor placing when a 1.75 lengths third over 390m at Ballarat, clocking 22.41. Leading player again. TOP KADE (3) turned in a better effort at Traralgon last start, finishing second behind Boss On Top (20.19) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expecting another good run. SPACE INVADER (1) can measure up with the right run.",
